  m_text: 'This is Ngee Ann Polytechnic''s library, home to three corners worth exploring:
    the Newspaper Reading Corner, the Comic Area, and the DVD & Blu-Ray Section.


    Click
    and drag to look around. Each corner has a guide to talk to and hotspots to click
    for clues, use them to solve the riddle hidden in that room and earn its medal.'
